+{
+  "title": "A standing horse for the Western Hotel yard",
+  "kind": "feature",
+  "items": [
+    "A reconstructed standing horse joins the 1835 Western Hotel wagon yard at full or balanced detail.",
+    "Its selection card credits the licensed model and states that the animal’s identity, breed and owner are unknown.",
+    "This first static example is unmounted, untied and unhitched; movement, riding and photographic refinement remain open."
+  ]
+}
