+# Standing horse intake V2 source delta review
+
+CLEAR at source level for root integration and separately authorized actual yard/normalized consumer validation. This closes the released-array blocker in frozen original120e565 proposal; that archive/review remain immutable history. Reviewed V2 consumer `65bce03ad9a165ba65ec7ee52eee10ae6ac29266bab38784b88a5d50ca3fd244`, support helper `b5168a4017898c823d498f456f16b08a2f742bcae73fe653becae346f3166a03`, scoped integration patch `c83d6242a908e81bd57f958bb3049d4fee26bfd12929fe39d052fcaf29ce72e6`. No browser/build/app/ticket/Git mutation or network operation performed.
+
+The yard constructor snapshots only triangles overlapping one declared support rectangle before returning to main's settleOnGpu. Normal town position/index arrays remain released; RELEASE_KEEP and harness policy are untouched. Public BatchedMesh instance/matrix/geometry-range APIs are present in actual Three0.185.1. Both builder and prebuilt replay use freshly appended contiguous undeleted instances, satisfying the helper's declared enumeration assumption. Snapshot transforms actual batch vertices into world coordinates, retains Float64 copies, then answers local bounded barycentric height queries without reading original arrays. Record/region/interior/treatment guards remain in the API. Later ground calls do not traverse the whole town batches.
+
+Retention is capped at one region,4m²,32 triangles and4096 typed-array bytes; the actual declared rectangle is0.8663174266m². Invalid/oversize/duplicate/empty/released inputs refuse support rather than guess. Ownership/census is explicit; yard disposal clears retained entries and byte/triangle/region counters. This is bounded triangle retention, not a town-wide geometry exemption or memory-cap increase. Capturing triangles considers overlapping triangle AABBs conservatively; actual counts/bytes are not established by source review.
+
+Independently projected all962 original and equal10mm contact annotations through the exact support rotation/heading: each of the rectangle's four edges has50mm margin. Independently executed a COPY of the existing CPU regression using real actual-vendor Three BatchedMesh: nine reference Raycaster heights match within1e−12, support survives position=null/index-empty release, and wrong region/record/outside, region cap, late capture and disposal controls pass. The two-triangle fixture retains144B. This proves the regression fixture and algorithm path, not the actual published yard. No yard/horse geometry build or browser ran here.
+
+Consumer delta only forwards ground_support_region_id to the ground API; the native-skinned source, normalization/support/material/confidence/lifecycle/attribution findings of the original review carry forward. Scene declares only the bounded1835 support region; no inherited horse in1812/1904. Root's1mm per-foot minimum development bound and no sampled penetration remain actual-readback requirements.
+
+Still require actual normal coarse upload-release without keep-geometry, published/built cache census within caps, all962 actual triangle-surface queries and per-foot minima/no penetration, resource disposal/tier recovery, exact source parity and normalized/yard desktop/mobile appearance. Root owns package/source/license integration, cap/gate and actual release. No photographic, anatomical sole, continuous collision or historical-individual acceptance is granted.
